+# Changes, round 1
+
+Addresses the two finding groups in REVIEW.md (round 0).
+
+1. Undefined in `over` counts as not given (4 failures). `merge` in
+   `src/layer.mjs` now skips any `over` key whose value is `undefined`, at every
+   depth: base's value is kept (deep-copied), and an `over`-only key with
+   `undefined` does not appear. `copy` also drops `undefined`-valued object keys
+   (including in base), so results never carry an `undefined` property. Test:
+   "layer treats undefined in over as not given, at every depth".
+
+2. Values that are not plain data throw TypeError (7 failures). A new `check`
+   pass runs over both arguments before merging and throws TypeError for any
+   value that is not a primitive, array, plain object (including null-prototype)
+   or Date: functions, Map, Set, RegExp, class instances, at any depth and
+   inside arrays, in base or over (even where over would replace it). `copy` no
+   longer uses `structuredClone` or passes such values through. Tests: "layer
+   throws a TypeError for values that are not plain data, wherever they sit" and
+   "layer still accepts primitives, arrays, plain objects and Dates".
+
+CHANGELOG.md is unchanged this round (the round-0 line still describes `layer`).
